title: Sol LeWitt
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

American artist (1928–2007), a founder of conceptual art and minimalism. Known for wall drawings that other people carry out from his written instructions.

Author of “Paragraphs on Conceptual Art” (//Artforum//, 1967): “The idea becomes a machine that makes the art.”

